{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41211","headline":"出山吟 · 黄损","name":"出山吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"来书初出白云扃，乍蹑秋风马走轻。\n远近留连分岳色，别离呜咽乱泉声。\n休将巢许争喧杂，自共伊臯论太平。\n昨夜细看云色里，进贤星座甚分明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄损","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41211.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41211","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}